<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Not My Paradiso"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Mili"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Not My Paradiso"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="3409588399"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:59.392"><div begin="2.148" end="3:59.392"><p begin="2.148" end="6.165" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2.148" end="2.561">You</span> <span begin="2.561" end="2.995">said</span> <span begin="2.995" end="3.163">let</span> <span begin="3.163" end="3.569">there</span> <span begin="3.569" end="4.024">be</span> <span begin="4.024" end="6.165">light</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你说，要有光</span></p><p begin="6.165" end="9.820" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="6.165" end="6.544">Deleted</span> <span begin="6.544" end="7.061">all</span> <span begin="7.061" end="7.545">the</span> <span begin="7.545" end="7.979">good</span> <span begin="7.979" end="8.917">from</span> <span begin="8.917" end="9.413">the</span> <span begin="9.413" end="9.820">dark</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">便抹去了黑暗中所有的微芒</span></p><p begin="9.820" end="13.495" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="9.820" end="10.072">Picked</span> <span begin="10.072" end="10.219">out</span> <span begin="10.219" end="10.408">the</span> <span begin="10.408" end="11.233">sweetest</span> <span begin="11.233" end="11.675">fruits</span> <span begin="11.675" end="12.501">from</span> <span begin="12.501" end="12.928">the</span> <span begin="12.928" end="13.495">tart</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从酸涩中挑拣出最甜美的果实</span></p><p begin="13.495" end="22.343" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.495" end="13.600">To</span> <span begin="13.600" end="13.753">make</span> <span begin="13.753" end="13.949">the</span> <span begin="13.949" end="14.265">good</span> <span begin="14.265" end="14.657">even</span> <span begin="14.657" end="15.273">better,</span> <span begin="15.273" end="15.735">you</span> <span begin="15.735" end="16.155">had</span> <span begin="16.155" end="16.624">to</span> <span begin="16.624" end="17.079">make</span> <span begin="17.079" end="17.597">the</span> <span begin="17.597" end="18.612">evil</span> <span begin="18.612" end="22.343">worse</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了让至善更臻完美，你不得不让罪恶更显深重</span></p><p begin="26.017" end="29.679" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.017" end="26.256">Once</span> <span begin="26.256" end="27.040">again</span> <span begin="27.040" end="27.271">I</span> <span begin="27.271" end="27.600">am</span> <span begin="27.600" end="27.936">here</span> <span begin="27.936" end="28.279">at</span> <span begin="28.279" end="28.517">your</span> <span begin="28.517" end="29.679">mercy</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而今我再次置身于你的慈悲</span></p><p begin="29.679" end="33.269" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.679" end="29.896">Tell</span> <span begin="29.896" end="30.316">me,</span> <span begin="30.316" end="30.624">am</span> <span begin="30.624" end="30.939">I</span> <span begin="30.939" end="31.457">naive</span> <span begin="31.457" end="31.785">enough</span> <span begin="31.785" end="32.024">to</span> <span begin="32.024" end="32.444">be</span> <span begin="32.444" end="32.899">let</span> <span begin="32.899" end="33.269">in</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我，我是否足够天真，才得以被准许入内</span></p><p begin="33.269" end="34.957" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.269" end="34.033">Greetings</span> <span begin="34.033" end="34.320">to</span> <span begin="34.320" end="34.663">your</span> <span begin="34.663" end="34.957">virgins</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向你的处子们致意</span></p><p begin="34.957" end="36.847" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.957" end="35.537">Talila</span> <span begin="35.537" end="36.847">tulula</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">塔里拉，图鲁拉</span></p><p begin="36.847" end="38.449" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.847" end="37.133">And</span> <span begin="37.133" end="37.323">now</span> <span begin="37.323" end="37.568">shall</span> <span begin="37.568" end="37.904">we</span> <span begin="37.904" end="38.449">begin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那么，审判是否该开始了</span></p><p begin="38.449" end="40.501" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.449" end="40.501">Tulilula</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">图利鲁拉</span></p><p begin="40.607" end="44.051" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.607" end="40.866">Stripping</span> <span begin="40.866" end="41.271">down</span> <span begin="41.271" end="41.579">all</span> <span begin="41.579" end="41.887">the</span> <span begin="41.887" end="42.154">way</span> <span begin="42.154" end="42.384">to</span> <span begin="42.384" end="42.875">our</span> <span begin="42.875" end="43.519">bare</span> <span begin="43.519" end="44.051">skins</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">剥落伪饰，直至赤裸全躯</span></p><p begin="44.051" end="47.879" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.051" end="44.254">And</span> <span begin="44.254" end="44.519">dance</span> <span begin="44.519" end="44.702">with</span> <span begin="44.702" end="44.904">the</span> <span begin="44.904" end="45.191">blind</span> <span begin="45.191" end="45.548">in</span> <span begin="45.548" end="45.794">the</span> <span begin="45.794" end="46.487">garden</span> <span begin="46.487" end="46.739">of</span> <span begin="46.739" end="47.879">eden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与盲者在伊甸园中狂舞</span></p><p begin="47.871" end="49.447" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.871" end="48.243">Open</span> <span begin="48.243" end="48.370">one</span> <span begin="48.370" end="48.551">of</span> <span begin="48.551" end="48.838">your</span> <span begin="48.838" end="49.447">cages</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">打开你的一座囚笼</span></p><p begin="49.447" end="51.450" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.447" end="50.139">Talila</span> <span begin="50.139" end="51.450">tulula</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">塔里拉，图鲁拉</span></p><p begin="51.450" end="54.563" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.450" end="51.903">Staining</span> <span begin="51.903" end="52.178">one</span> <span begin="52.178" end="52.359">of</span> <span begin="52.359" end="52.687">your</span> <span begin="52.687" end="53.059">angels</span> <span begin="53.059" end="53.234">a</span> <span begin="53.234" end="53.374">little</span> <span begin="53.374" end="53.675">bit</span> <span begin="53.675" end="54.563">black</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将你的一位天使，染上一抹漆黑</span></p><p begin="54.563" end="58.174" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.563" end="55.534">Goodbye,</span> <span begin="55.534" end="55.794">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="55.794" end="56.163">miss</span> <span begin="56.163" end="56.690">me</span> <span begin="56.690" end="57.739">too</span> <span begin="57.739" end="58.174">much</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再见，别太想念我</span></p><p begin="58.607" end="1:00.251" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.607" end="59.439">Michaela,</span> <span begin="59.439" end="1:00.251">Bezaliela</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">米凯拉，贝扎里拉</span></p><p begin="1:00.251" end="1:02.183" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.251" end="1:00.798">Maalika,</span> <span begin="1:00.798" end="1:01.315">Uriela,</span> <span begin="1:01.315" end="1:02.183">Samaela</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">玛丽卡，乌里拉，萨麦尔</span></p><p begin="1:02.183" end="1:03.962" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.183" end="1:03.023">Barachiela,</span> <span begin="1:03.023" end="1:03.962">Jegudiela</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">巴拉基拉，耶古迪拉</span></p><p begin="1:03.962" end="1:05.803" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.962" end="1:04.395">Daniela,</span> <span begin="1:04.395" end="1:04.907">Gabriela,</span> <span begin="1:04.907" end="1:05.803">Netzacha</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">丹妮拉，加百列，内扎哈</span></p><p begin="1:05.803" end="1:07.587" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.803" end="1:06.762">Raphaela,</span> <span begin="1:06.762" end="1:07.587">Kasdeja</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拉斐拉，卡斯德嘉</span></p><p begin="1:07.587" end="1:09.751" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.587" end="1:08.222">Yomiela,</span> <span begin="1:08.222" end="1:08.939">Ariela,</span> <span begin="1:08.939" end="1:09.751">Beburosa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">约米拉，阿里拉，贝布罗莎</span></p><p begin="1:09.751" end="1:13.195" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.751" end="1:10.331">Jophiela,</span> <span begin="1:10.331" end="1:11.199">Mastema,</span> <span begin="1:11.199" end="1:13.195">Zachariela</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">乔菲拉，玛斯特玛，扎查里拉</span></p><p begin="1:13.195" end="1:14.936" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.195" end="1:14.936">Oh</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">噢</span></p><p begin="1:14.936" end="1:18.543" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.936" end="1:15.679">Back</span> <span begin="1:15.679" end="1:16.232">to</span> <span begin="1:16.232" end="1:16.728">square</span> <span begin="1:16.728" end="1:18.543">one</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">回到原点</span></p><p begin="1:18.543" end="1:25.380" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.543" end="1:19.439">It&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:19.439" end="1:19.836">all-</span><span begin="1:19.836" end="1:20.335">or-</span><span begin="1:20.335" end="1:21.720">none</span> <span begin="1:21.720" end="1:22.211">for</span> <span begin="1:22.211" end="1:23.127">your</span> <span begin="1:23.127" end="1:24.051">binary</span> <span begin="1:24.051" end="1:25.380">mind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在你非黑即白的心智里，只有全无或全有</span></p><p begin="1:25.380" end="1:32.110" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.380" end="1:25.759">I</span> <span begin="1:25.759" end="1:27.281">frowned</span> <span begin="1:27.281" end="1:27.686">at</span> <span begin="1:27.686" end="1:27.918">the</span> <span begin="1:27.918" end="1:28.142">name</span> <span begin="1:28.142" end="1:28.386">you</span> <span begin="1:28.386" end="1:29.094">labeled</span> <span begin="1:29.094" end="1:29.521">your</span> <span begin="1:29.521" end="1:30.402">trophy</span> <span begin="1:30.402" end="1:32.110">case</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我对着你贴在“奖杯陈列柜”上的标签蹙眉</span></p><p begin="1:33.235" end="1:34.930" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:33.235" end="1:33.607">Please</span> <span begin="1:33.607" end="1:33.846">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:33.846" end="1:34.299">call</span> <span begin="1:34.299" end="1:34.482">it</span> <span begin="1:34.482" end="1:34.930">heaven</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请别称之为天堂</span></p><p begin="1:34.930" end="1:40.795" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.930" end="1:35.358">If</span> <span begin="1:35.358" end="1:35.587">your</span> <span begin="1:35.587" end="1:36.043">doors</span> <span begin="1:36.043" end="1:36.211">aren&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:36.211" end="1:36.735">open</span> <span begin="1:36.735" end="1:37.178">for</span> <span begin="1:37.178" end="1:37.402">the</span> <span begin="1:37.402" end="1:37.995">vast</span> <span begin="1:37.995" end="1:38.759">majority</span> <span begin="1:38.759" end="1:39.026">of</span> <span begin="1:39.026" end="1:39.507">your</span> <span begin="1:39.507" end="1:40.795">creations</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若你的大门不愿向绝大多数受造物敞开</span></p><p begin="1:40.795" end="1:47.594" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:40.795" end="1:41.643">Does</span> <span begin="1:41.643" end="1:42.119">my</span> <span begin="1:42.119" end="1:45.303">sincerity</span> <span begin="1:45.303" end="1:45.830">sound</span> <span begin="1:45.830" end="1:47.594">threatening</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的赤诚是否令你感到威胁</span></p><p begin="1:47.594" end="1:49.546" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:47.594" end="1:48.098">Pierce</span> <span begin="1:48.098" end="1:48.355">me</span> <span begin="1:48.355" end="1:48.790">with</span> <span begin="1:48.790" end="1:49.022">your</span> <span begin="1:49.022" end="1:49.546">judgements</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用你的审判将我刺穿吧</span></p><p begin="1:49.546" end="1:51.730" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:49.546" end="1:49.895">I</span> <span begin="1:49.895" end="1:50.134">have</span> <span begin="1:50.134" end="1:50.582">heard</span> <span begin="1:50.582" end="1:50.791">it</span> <span begin="1:50.791" end="1:51.002">a</span> <span begin="1:51.002" end="1:51.254">thousand</span> <span begin="1:51.254" end="1:51.730">times</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这些话我已经听过千遍</span></p><p begin="1:51.730" end="1:55.314" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:51.730" end="1:51.962">My</span> <span begin="1:51.962" end="1:52.410">heart</span> <span begin="1:52.410" end="1:52.639">too</span> <span begin="1:52.639" end="1:53.074">broken</span> <span begin="1:53.074" end="1:53.319">and</span> <span begin="1:53.319" end="1:53.530">my</span> <span begin="1:53.530" end="1:53.787">tear</span> <span begin="1:53.787" end="1:54.291">ducts</span> <span begin="1:54.291" end="1:54.775">too</span> <span begin="1:54.775" end="1:55.314">dry</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的心已太破碎，泪腺已太干涸</span></p><p begin="1:55.314" end="2:01.495" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:55.314" end="1:56.134">To</span> <span begin="1:56.134" end="1:57.302">worship</span> <span begin="1:57.302" end="1:57.618">your</span> <span begin="1:57.618" end="2:01.495">paradise</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法再去崇拜你那所谓的乐土</span></p><p begin="2:20.443" end="2:21.802" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:20.443" end="2:21.802">Look</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看啊</span></p><p begin="2:21.802" end="2:25.315" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:21.802" end="2:22.215">The</span> <span begin="2:22.215" end="2:23.126">fires</span> <span begin="2:23.126" end="2:23.531">are</span> <span begin="2:23.531" end="2:24.035">so</span> <span begin="2:24.035" end="2:25.315">pretty</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">烈火如此艳丽</span></p><p begin="2:25.315" end="2:28.978" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:25.315" end="2:25.707">As</span> <span begin="2:25.707" end="2:25.855">you</span> <span begin="2:25.855" end="2:26.247">burned</span> <span begin="2:26.247" end="2:26.695">me</span> <span begin="2:26.695" end="2:28.978">endlessly</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当你永无止境地焚烧我</span></p><p begin="2:28.978" end="2:35.398" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:28.978" end="2:29.370">Our</span> <span begin="2:29.370" end="2:30.434">love</span> <span begin="2:30.434" end="2:31.782">painfully</span> <span begin="2:31.782" end="2:35.398">everlasting</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的爱，痛楚且绵延不息</span></p><p begin="2:35.398" end="2:38.278" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:35.398" end="2:35.582">First,</span> <span begin="2:35.582" end="2:35.782">you</span> <span begin="2:35.782" end="2:35.982">hand</span> <span begin="2:35.982" end="2:36.358">picked</span> <span begin="2:36.358" end="2:36.558">a</span> <span begin="2:36.558" end="2:37.073">glob</span> <span begin="2:37.073" end="2:37.362">of</span> <span begin="2:37.362" end="2:38.082">meaty</span> <span begin="2:38.082" end="2:38.278">clay</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">起初，你捏起一团血肉之泥</span></p><p begin="2:38.278" end="2:39.638" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:38.278" end="2:38.493">You</span> <span begin="2:38.493" end="2:38.708">gave</span> <span begin="2:38.708" end="2:38.942">me</span> <span begin="2:38.942" end="2:39.208">some</span> <span begin="2:39.208" end="2:39.638">limbs</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">赐予我四肢</span></p><p begin="2:39.638" end="2:41.888" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:39.638" end="2:39.858">You</span> <span begin="2:39.858" end="2:40.078">gave</span> <span begin="2:40.078" end="2:40.302">me</span> <span begin="2:40.302" end="2:40.518">some</span> <span begin="2:40.518" end="2:41.048">brains,</span> <span begin="2:41.048" end="2:41.258">a</span> <span begin="2:41.258" end="2:41.708">pretty</span> <span begin="2:41.708" end="2:41.888">face</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">赐予我心智，一副姣好的容颜</span></p><p begin="2:41.888" end="2:43.268" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:41.888" end="2:42.122">You</span> <span begin="2:42.122" end="2:42.362">told</span> <span begin="2:42.362" end="2:42.608">me</span> <span begin="2:42.608" end="2:42.842">to</span> <span begin="2:42.842" end="2:43.268">applaud</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你命令我鼓掌喝彩</span></p><p begin="2:43.268" end="2:44.673" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:43.268" end="2:43.522">Can&apos;t</span> <span begin="2:43.522" end="2:43.742">do,</span> <span begin="2:43.742" end="2:44.673">shouganai</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">恕难从命，万般无奈</spa