:54.248" end="2:54.473">to</span> <span begin="2:54.473" end="2:56.773">paradiso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从地狱重返乐土</span></p><p begin="2:56.773" end="2:59.253" itunes:key="L49" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:56.773" end="2:57.198">“Let</span> <span begin="2:57.198" end="2:57.378">us</span> <span begin="2:57.378" end="2:57.838">go</span> <span begin="2:57.838" end="2:58.093">to</span> <span begin="2:58.093" end="2:58.522">heaven</span> <span begin="2:58.522" end="2:59.253">together”</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“让我们一起去天堂吧”</span></p><p begin="2:59.253" end="3:00.393" itunes:key="L50" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:59.253" end="2:59.613">“Here,</span> <span begin="2:59.613" end="2:59.873">take</span> <span begin="2:59.873" end="3:00.193">my</span> <span begin="3:00.193" end="3:00.393">hand”</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“来，握住我的手”</span></p><p begin="3:00.393" end="3:03.748" itunes:key="L51" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:00.393" end="3:01.078">Kisses</span> <span begin="3:01.078" end="3:01.473">felt</span> <span begin="3:01.473" end="3:01.742">so</span> <span begin="3:01.742" end="3:02.182">pleasant,</span> <span begin="3:02.182" end="3:02.373">I</span> <span begin="3:02.373" end="3:02.588">almost</span> <span begin="3:02.588" end="3:03.258">forgot</span> <span begin="3:03.258" end="3:03.498">the</span> <span begin="3:03.498" end="3:03.748">times</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">吻曾如此甜美，让我几欲忘却</span></p><p begin="3:03.748" end="3:05.337" itunes:key="L52" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:03.748" end="3:03.973">You</span> <span begin="3:03.973" end="3:04.388">said</span> <span begin="3:04.388" end="3:04.698">you&apos;re</span> <span begin="3:04.698" end="3:05.337">sorry</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你曾说很抱歉</span></p><p begin="3:05.337" end="3:08.672" itunes:key="L53" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:05.337" end="3:05.392">That</span> <span begin="3:0