67">the</span> <span begin="3:52.167" end="3:52.377">world</span> <span begin="3:52.377" end="3:53.287">balanced</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让这世界重归平衡</span></p><p begin="3:53.287" end="3:59.392" itunes:key="L66" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:53.287" end="3:54.047">You</span> <span begin="3:54.047" end="3:54.936">can</span> <span begin="3:54.936" end="3:55.807">love</span> <span begin="3:55.807" end="3:57.267">me</span> <span begin="3:57.267" end="3:59.392">then</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">届时，你便能爱我了</span></p></div></body></tt>